 1080)]. This hierarchical architecture shows a complex product design where hazardous substance risks are localized to specific components (e.g., circuit boards and compressor protector), enabling targeted compliance measures.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Use of cyclopentane as an eco-friendly blowing agent\",\n            \"explanation\": \"The product uses cyclopentane as a foam blowing agent for insulation, which is highlighted as an environmentally friendly alternative to ozone-depleting substances like CFCs and HCFCs [Data: Entities (877); Relationships (1061)]. Cyclopentane provides low thermal conductivity, improving energy efficiency and reducing environmental impact. This aligns with the product's high energy efficiency rating of class 1 and its low noise level of 36 dB(A) [Data: Entities (872, 883); Relationships (1016, 1051)]. The use of cyclopentane reflects a commitment to sustainable manufacturing practices.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Documentation and language specificity for Chinese market\",\n            \"explanation\": \"All product documentation is in Simplified Chinese, as indicated by the entity '简体中文' [Data: Entities (37); Relationships (1109)]. The manual includes page references and a model identifier DA68-04798 [Data: Entities (945, 955); Relationships (1097, 1110)]. This localization ensures that compliance information, including hazardous substance warnings and recycling instructions, is accessible to Chinese consumers and regulators. The product's rating of 36 dB(A) noise level and dimensions like 834×600×1920 mm are also tailored to market expectations [Data: Entities (883, 907); Relationships (1050, 1051)].\"\n        }\n    ]\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "created": 1780239246, "model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "objec